    "name":  "LED Bulb - Modern Smoked Glass - 4W - E27 - G125",
    "reference":  "NEWGLASS-4W-GW-91067",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThis \u003cstrong\u003eG125 Bulb\u003c/strong\u003e made in \u003cstrong\u003eSmoked Crystal\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003e4W\u003c/strong\u003e power and PMMA engraved inside, with\u003cstrong\u003e E27\u003c/strong\u003e type socket, helps to respect the planet due to its energy saving. The bulb has a modern and elegant design, with a black metal housing that fits perfectly with any interior decoration. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese bulbs not only illuminate your spaces with a \u003cstrong\u003ewarm and welcoming light\u003c/strong\u003e, but also add a touch of sophistication thanks to their neat glass design. Transform any environment into a unique and stylish space with these decorative bulbs, perfect for pendant lamps, wall sconces or any fixture that uses an E27 socket.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eModern Smoked Crystal LED Light Bulb 4W E27 G125\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe design of this \u003cstrong\u003e4W E27 G125 Smoked Crystal bulb\u003c/strong\u003e is an excellent choice for those looking for an energy efficient alternative to decorate your store or home.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bulb has a modern and sleek design, featuring a \u003cstrong\u003eSmoked Crystal\u003c/strong\u003e housing, with an etched PMMA interior that fits perfectly with any interior decor. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis bulb is versatile and suitable for a variety of uses:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGeneral lighting in homes, offices and commercial establishments.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDecorative lighting in common areas of the home, accent lighting in hallways and stairways, task lighting in office areas.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlso to illuminate reading areas, stores and exhibitions in showrooms.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe use it can have is multiple, from bulb as its main use, to as a home lamp to give a special and authentically nostalgic combination. Only our online store offers a 3 year warranty on this product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of Modern Smoked Crystal LED Light Bulb 4W E27 G125\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGeneral lighting in homes, offices and commercial establishments.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDecorative lighting in living rooms, bedrooms, dining rooms and other common areas of the home.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAccent lighting in hallways, stairways, closets and other transit areas in the home.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWork lighting in office areas, desks and other workstations.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLighting in reading areas, whether in homes or libraries.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStore and display lighting in stores and showrooms.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each \u003cstrong\u003eLED\u003c/strong\u003e product.\u003c/p\u003e",
